OL,3,GNEWSAScottish hospitals told corridor
OL,4,Acare 'unacceptable' in new NHS plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS boards have been told that caring
OL,7,Ffor patients in corridors is
OL,8,F"unacceptable", under new Scottish
OL,9,Fgovernment plans to clear bottlenecks
OL,10,Fin hospitals.
OL,12,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance said
OL,13,Fthe scheme would improve the flow of
OL,14,Fpatients through hospitals - with a
OL,15,Ffocus on emergencies, life-threatening
OL,16,Fconditions and specialist care.
OL,18,FConstance said the scheme would deliver
OL,19,Fmore treatment at home and in
OL,20,Fcommunities, and there would be new
OL,21,Fhubs to direct people to these sources
OL,22,Fof care.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
