OL,3,GNEWSAScottish hospitals told corridor
OL,4,Acare 'unacceptable' in new NHS plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Health and Care Improving Flow Plan
OL,7,Fasks health boards to reduce corridor
OL,8,Fcare and states that it "should be
OL,9,Feradicated".
